Bilkul 👍 Main is TryHackMe Networking Basics wale content ko simple Hinglish mein samjha deta hoon.

1. Network kya hota hai?

Simple language mein:

Network = 2 ya 2 se zyada devices ka connected hona.

Jaise:

Tumhara phone + laptop Wi-Fi se connected hain.
Office ke saare computers ek network mein hain.
City mein buses/trains ka connected system bhi ek type ka network hai.

Computing mein devices ho sakte hain:

Laptop
Mobile
Server
CCTV camera
Traffic light
Smart devices
2. Internet kya hai?

Internet = bahut saare chhote networks ka ek huge network.

Example:

Socho Alice, Bob aur Jim friends hain → ek chhota network.

Ab Alice ki friendship Zayn aur Toby se bhi hai. Alice un dono ko Bob/Jim se connect karwa sakti hai.

Computers mein bhi exactly isi concept ka large-scale version hota hai.

Internet ke 2 broad types samjho:

Private Network
→ Ek limited/local network, jaise ghar ka Wi-Fi.

Public Network
→ Aise networks jo different private networks ko connect karte hain — broadly, Internet.

3. IP Address kya hai?

IP address ko device ka network address samjho.

Jaise tumhare ghar ka address hota hai jahan parcel deliver hota hai, waise network mein IP address device ko locate/identify karne mein help karta hai.

Example IPv4:

192.168.1.77

IPv4 address mein 4 parts (octets) hote hain:

192 . 168 . 1 . 77

Har part ki value generally 0–255 ke beech hoti hai.

Important:

IP address change ho sakta hai.

For example, tumhara laptop aaj:

192.168.1.77

use kar raha ho, aur baad mein router tumhe koi doosra private IP de sakta hai.

4. Public IP vs Private IP

Ye bahut important hai.

Private IP

Local network ke andar device ko identify karta hai.

Example:

192.168.1.77

Agar tumhare ghar mein laptop aur phone hain, dono ke alag private IP ho sakte hain:

Laptop → 192.168.1.77
Phone  → 192.168.1.74


Ye dono ek doosre se local network par communicate kar sakte hain.

Public IP

Internet par tumhare network ko identify karta hai.

Example:

Laptop → 192.168.1.77 ┐
                     ├→ Router → Public IP → Internet
Phone  → 192.168.1.74 ┘


Isliye ek hi ghar ke multiple devices same public IP se Internet par appear kar sakte hain.

5. IPv4 aur IPv6
IPv4

IPv4 mein 32 bits hote hain.

Isliye total possible addresses:

2³² ≈ 4.29 billion

Problem ye hai ki Internet par devices bahut zyada ho gaye hain.

IPv6

IPv6 mein 128 bits hote hain.

Total possibilities:

2¹²⁸

Ye IPv4 se enormously zyada addresses provide karta hai.

Yaad rakho:

IPv4 = 32-bit
IPv6 = 128-bit

6. MAC Address kya hai?

MAC address ko device ke network hardware ka unique identifier samjho.

Example:

a4:c3:f0:85:ac:2d

Ye hexadecimal format mein hota hai.

Usually:

a4:c3:f0 : 85:ac:2d
   ↓          ↓
Manufacturer  Unique part


Simple analogy:

IP address → ghar ka temporary/addressable location
MAC address → network hardware ka identity/serial-number jaisa
Important difference

IP address change ho sakta hai.

MAC address normally network interface ke hardware se associated hota hai, although software ke through MAC ko spoof/change kiya ja sakta hai.

7. MAC Spoofing kya hai?

Spoofing = apni identity ko kisi doosre device jaisa dikhana.

Example:

Hotel Wi-Fi mein:

Alice → MAC = AAAA → Paid → Internet allowed ✅

Bob   → MAC = BBBB → Not paid → Blocked ❌


Agar Bob apna MAC address Alice ke MAC jaisa kar de:

Bob → MAC = AAAA


To poorly designed system Bob ko Alice samajh sakta hai.

Isi ko MAC spoofing kehte hain.

⚠️ Real networks mein authorization bypass karna illegal/unauthorized ho sakta hai; TryHackMe lab mein ye concept safely practice karne ke liye diya gaya hai.

8. Ping kya hai?

Ping = check karna ki ek device/network destination reachable hai ya nahi, aur response kitni jaldi aa raha hai.

Ping ICMP protocol use karta hai.

Basic idea:

Your computer
     |
     | ICMP Echo Request
     ↓
 Target
     |
     | ICMP Echo Reply
     ↓
Your computer


Agar target reply karta hai, tumhe response time milta hai.

Example:

Reply from 192.168.1.254
time=4ms


Matlab target reachable hai aur response approximately 4 milliseconds mein aaya.

9. Tumhare TryHackMe task mein kya karna hai?

Question mein specifically bola hai:

8.8.8.8 ko ping karo.

Linux terminal mein:

ping 8.8.8.8


Windows par:

ping 8.8.8.8


TryHackMe ke deployable website/machine par ye command run karni hai.

Task ke according, correct address ko ping karne par flag reveal hoga, jise question ke answer ke roop mein submit karna hai.

